  "2026-10-24T06:39:29.560Z",codex-agent,"Class 1 behavioral revert: replaced only discoverPolicyCards with the former unguarded inventory decoder. node --test --test-name-pattern='seeded foreign tracker' test/policy-card.test.ts exited 1: 0/1 passed, 1 failed with SyntaxError from a foreign body. Restored the function in finally. Class 2 behavioral revert: replaced only the promotion reconciliation catch with the previous refusal path. node --test --test-name-pattern='shared tracker loop interleavings' test/policy-card.test.ts exited 1: 4/15 passed, 11 failed, including already_promoted and an incorrect zero promotion count. Restored in finally. Test SHA-256 remained db7af2904a544c4852b9c192f3865103b554664b8a32fa70f46e9f79acb73225 throughout both proofs. Source/test bytes were verified against the package worktree after restoration. The real PM-linked focused suite passes 31/31, zero skips, with pm_context_mode=none and workspace_context_mode=snapshot; result tracking is disabled by existing policy, so this comment retains the receipt. Corrected owned-budget/job integrity and refusal-code regressions pass 5/5. No SDK pin or gate threshold changes."
  "2026-10-24T06:40:02.921Z",codex-agent,"Final local verification: the restored isolated source snapshot and pinned PM-linked source snapshot both pass 31/31 with zero skips; the shared decoder has 100% line, branch and function coverage in the focused run. Typecheck, test compilation, lint, zero duplication and the docstring gate pass (52 sources, 397 declarations). Complete decoder/transition audit and independent revert receipts are retained in docs/policy-card-write-audit.md. Current origin/main is already contained in this branch. Local health reports the existing installed extension host version skew; no dependency pins or history were rewritten. Releasing this claim without closing the item; the pushed head must pass the npm and Bun CI release matrix before being considered gate-complete."
  "2026-10-24T06:52:46.295Z",codex-agent,"The focused raw coverage probe passes 31/31 and confirms the decoder shape checks are exercised. It identified additional transition guards needing direct coverage: a peer-completed promotion receipt, a peer winning after a legacy refusal observation, and unavailable authoritative-status reads. Adding real-tracker behavioral cases for those guards before the final CI head. The production fixes and original revert-proof assertions remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-24T08:38:37.872Z",codex-agent,"First full CI run 40071115142 exposed the missing guarded-parser file in the minimal Compose trainer image and replay compatibility failures; corrected the explicit image manifest, deterministic skipped-record inventory, promotion-author expectation after a child process commits, and budget-refusal precedence. Additional real-tracker tests cover legacy reordered records, immutable creation identity, foreign suffix copies, null authoritative job replacement, and damaged owned reservations. Foreign records are skipped while owned capacity corruption remains an integrity refusal. Typecheck, test compilation, lint, duplicate checks and docstrings pass: 52 sources, 403 declarations. Repeating the two production-only revert proofs and the final PM-linked suite before pushing the follow-up."
  "2026-10-24T08:40:32.681Z",codex-agent,"Final class revert proofs repeated on the exact final production/test snapshot. Class 1: revert only discoverPolicyCards, run node --test --test-name-pattern=\"seeded foreign tracker\" test/policy-card.test.ts: exit 1, 0/1 pass, SyntaxError. Class 2: revert only executePendingGeneration promotion reconciliation catch, run node --test --test-name-pattern=\"shared tracker loop interleavings\" test/policy-card.test.ts: exit 1, 4/15 pass and 11 fail, including peer promotion counted as zero. Both restored in finally; source/test bytes verified equal to the package worktree; unchanged test SHA-256 ebb80010f6303cbf17c9a8fd64aabad97f70df926a14bb2dc4141e4f01dee8eb. PM-linked final focused command passes 44/44, zero failures/cancellations/skips, including deterministic replay, SIGKILL recovery, legacy reservations, ownership copies and authoritative replacement. Existing result tracking is disabled, so this comment retains the receipt. Typecheck, test compilation, lint, zero duplication, docstrings and minimal trainer source smoke pass. origin/main is contained. Full npm and Bun release evidence is required from the follow-up pushed-head CI matrix at unchanged thresholds. No dependency pins, coverage limits or history records rewritten; releasing without closing."
  "2026-10-24T09:19:14.804Z",codex-agent,"CI run 40078982664 Node 22 passes all 836 tests with zero skips, but fails the unchanged 100% branch threshold: index.ts 99.94%, policy-card.ts 99.78%, aggregate 99.97%. All other modules, all lines and all functions are 100%. Reclaimed to add direct behavioral coverage for the two remaining guards; no production behavior or thresholds will be weakened."
  "2026-10-24T09:38:33.747Z",codex-agent,"All three jobs in CI 40078982664 pass 836/836 tests, zero failures/skips, and stop solely at aggregate 99.97% branch coverage. Added all invalid completed-receipt field cases and real pre-card legacy rejection resume without a sealed evaluation; both controllers preserve the original numerical verdict and reason. No production code or thresholds changed. Final PM-linked suite passes 46/46 with zero skips; local typecheck, test compilation, lint, duplicate and docstring gates pass. Repeated both independent production-only reverts against final test SHA-256 21edb7e6df8802dce83abe8d26f5a8cd897d02ceb31f55fe2db3acb42cd49009: discovery 0/1 pass, SyntaxError, exit 1; transition reconciliation 4/15 pass, 11 fail, exit 1. Both restored in finally and all source/test bytes match. Final npm/Bun CI matrix remains required at unchanged thresholds; releasing without closing."
  "2026-10-24T10:00:07.566Z",codex-agent,"CI 40082789577 Bun passes 837/837 tests with zero skips. policy-card.ts now has 100% coverage in every native dimension; one index.ts branch remains at 99.94%, aggregate 99.98%. Reclaimed to locate the exact remaining path through targeted LCOV evidence. No thresholds or production behavior will be changed to hide the gap."
  "2026-10-24T10:18:46.940Z",codex-agent,"Final receipt-integrity matrix passes all 15 hostile replacements plus SDK repair, one-promotion agreement and adoption. It reaches semantic key/input/state and payload validation after ownership decoding, including Task/Note types, Markdown, truncated/oversized/deep JSON and a same-tag foreign format. The positive candidate evaluation is unchanged by every refusal. Final pinned PM suite passes 47/47 with zero failures/cancellations/skips under the original 600-second command limit. Typecheck, test compilation, lint, duplicate and docstring gates pass (52 sources, 403 declarations). Final production-only revert proofs: discovery 0/1 pass with SyntaxError, transition catch 4/15 pass and 11 fail; both exit 1, restored in finally, all source/test bytes verified. Unchanged test SHA-256 e01471b5230116820d9e26113e5812e9bd0fe5a818d1b7027fbe0ebaff2359d3. The broader local LCOV diagnostic was interrupted after isolating the guards and is not counted as release evidence. Previous CI 40082789577 passes 837/837 tests in all three jobs but fails the unchanged branch threshold; final pushed-head npm/Bun CI remains required. No production code, dependency pins, thresholds or history records were changed for the coverage completion. Releasing without closing."
  "2026-10-24T10:41:58.086Z",codex-agent,"CI 40085434477 Node 26 passes 838/838 tests, zero skips, but index.ts remains at 99.94% branches (99.98% aggregate). Reclaimed to add failure-only LCOV line diagnostics to CI at unchanged commands and thresholds, so the remaining path is identified from exact CI evidence rather than inferred from partial local coverage. The completed 47-test PM and restored-snapshot suites remain valid passing evidence."
  "2026-10-24T11:09:21.928Z",codex-agent,"Final authoritative pending-state receipt: typed transition errors expose only canonical id, promotion flag, bounded evaluation enum and observed revision; a stale error code cannot invent a refusal. All six concurrent-refusal codes plus an unrelated native error preserve an unsealed peer candidate; after explicit evidence restoration both controllers agree on the peer promotion and adoption. Transition-focused suite passes 19/19. Final non-git PM snapshot suite passes 48/48, zero failures/cancellations/skips; the Git-dependent workflow self-scan passes separately 1/1 through PM in the actual checkout. Removed the mis-scoped combined snapshot test link after its Git inventory failure, retaining append-only history. Workflow YAML parses and failure-only LCOV diagnostics were checked against real coverage data; release commands, permissions and thresholds are unchanged. Typecheck, test compilation, lint, zero duplication and docstrings pass (52 sources, 403 declarations). Repeated production-only revert proofs on final test SHA-256 b69e3b15aa4bc2c4e408b6dbd5ec1702b916b0f6ceab7d55e888bf8041f7885e: discovery 0/1 pass with SyntaxError, transition reconciliation 4/15 pass and 11 fail, both exit 1; restored in finally and matching source/test bytes verified. Final pushed-head full npm/Bun CI remains required. Releasing without closing."
  "2026-10-24T11:43:03.653Z",codex-agent,"CI 40088775653 Node 26 passes 839/839 tests, zero skips; failure-only diagnostics identify the remaining uncovered branch at index.ts:787 in mutateLoopItem catch/finally. Reclaimed to test native and typed mutation callback errors, authoritative-read failures and dependency release through the real SDK. Broadening metadata observation beyond the single loop_write_conflict code closes the generic typed-refusal class while preserving original errors."
  "2026-10-24T11:53:07.585Z",codex-agent,"Final mutation/refusal verification: all typed mutation errors re-read current id/status/revision metadata; observation failure records only a bounded code and preserves the original error. Native and typed callback failures leave item bytes unchanged and release dependency claims, proven by an independent writer retry. Success snapshots its result before unlock and returns after finally, eliminating the unreachable normal-completion join without changing cleanup semantics. Three SDK transaction tests pass 3/3 and enter all 15 raw V8 ranges in mutateLoopItem. Final non-git PM suite passes 49/49, zero failures/cancellations/skips; the Git-dependent workflow check separately passes 1/1. Typecheck, test compilation, lint, zero duplication, docstrings (52 sources, 403 declarations) and workflow validation pass. Final test SHA-256 146c0564cc09ec973d358688e850ea7e1b67a56408dbbbea79e86a93a5b8a167. Production-only reverts: discovery 0/1 pass with SyntaxError; promotion reconciliation 4/15 pass, 11 fail; narrowing metadata observation back to loop_write_conflict fails 1/1. All exit 1, restore in finally and match source/test bytes afterward. Full npm/Bun CI at unchanged thresholds remains required on the final pushed head. Releasing without closing."
  "2026-10-24T13:22:50.853Z",codex-agent,"Round 7: auditing canonical identifier flow before every identity set, sort, digest and comparison, and resumable promotion/publication step boundaries. Will add seeded round-trip properties and fault-boundary recovery proofs, retain unchanged coverage gates, and use CI npm/Bun release gates."
